      <li id="src-1">del Hoyo, J. et al. (eds., 2009). <em>Handbook of the Birds of the World</em>, vol. 14. Lynx Edicions. — weight data per species.</li>
      <li id="src-2">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). In <em>Birds of the World</em> (A.F. Poole, ed.). Cornell Lab of Ornithology. — Common Raven measurements.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed study or field-guide data</p>
  </section>

